          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）2%贮存液:取 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\mathrm{g}\\ \\mathrm{O}_{5}\\mathrm{O}_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 安瓿泡酸 48h，冲洗 48h，双蒸水漂洗 30min。干后用玻璃刀刻划 1 或 2 道痕，置入棕色磨口瓶，加双蒸水 50ml，用力摇动使安瓿破碎。静置 48h "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{O}_{5}\\mathrm{O}_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 溶解后备用。4℃避光保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
