          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.467,
            0.9,
            0.529
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "使用时根据不同硬度要求按一定比例（1:1～1:9）混合，A液多，则软。AB液混匀后，逐滴加入DMP-30，其浓度控制在1%～2%。边加边搅，充分搅拌30min左右。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.532,
            0.9,
            0.594
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 乙酸铀染液:乙酸双氧铀 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{UO}_{2}(\\mathrm{C}_{2}\\mathrm{H}_{3}\\mathrm{O}_{2})_{2} \\cdot 2\\mathrm{H}_{2}\\mathrm{O}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (uranium acetate) 溶于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\% \\sim 70\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 乙醇溶液中至饱和，静置 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\sim 2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 天，使未溶的部分沉淀，取上部黄色透明溶液用，避光保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.598,
            0.331,
            0.615
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 柠檬酸铅溶液"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.619,
            0.9,
            0.68
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）A 液: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Pb(NO_{3})_{2}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （必须为新近产品）1.33g，柠檬酸钠（ "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Na_{3}C_{6}H_{5}O_{7}\\cdot2H_{2}O"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ）1.76g，双蒸水（用前加热沸腾后冷却）30ml，充分摇匀，混悬液为乳白色柠檬酸铅铬合物。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
